<title>JAPAN: Daiwa Bank forgives 62 bln yen mortgage firm loans.</title>
<headline>Daiwa Bank forgives 62 bln yen mortgage firm loans.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Daiwa Bank Ltd said on Monday that it had forgiven 62 billion yen worth of loans it had extended to Nippon Housing Loan Co Ltd.</p>
<p>It also said that forgiving these loans would not affect its forecast for its earnings for the business year ending March 31, 1997.</p>
</text>
